  "description": "One of the oldest surviving Meitei mythological texts and ritual treatises. It chronicles the archaic era when two sun brothers shone simultaneously in the sky, scorching the earth, until the heroic archer Khwai Nongchenbam shot one sun with an arrow, restoring diurnal balance, hymns of sunrise, and cosmic harmony to Kangleipak.",
